WEBVTT

00:11.716 --> 00:14.981
Hanaukyo Maid Team

00:15.921 --> 00:21.689
Asa no mado wo aketanara.

00:21.760 --> 00:29.292
Hikari no hana
sekai wo tsutsumu.

00:29.367 --> 00:35.237
Mune no naka ni nemutte iru...

00:35.307 --> 00:43.271
...omoi ga ima tokete ikuyou.

00:43.348 --> 00:48.581
Kisetsu no nioi dakishimeteru.

00:49.721 --> 00:55.956
Anata ni negatte...

00:56.027 --> 00:58.996
Aitakatta...

00:59.064 --> 01:02.727
...umareta hi kara zutto.

01:02.801 --> 01:05.668
Anata hitori...

01:05.737 --> 01:10.333
...mamoritai hito ga iru.

01:10.408 --> 01:12.467
Anata dake...

01:12.544 --> 01:14.603
...furetai.

01:15.881 --> 01:20.841
Kono te wo tsunaguno.

01:22.654 --> 01:24.622
Todoketai.

01:25.924 --> 01:28.358
Voice of my heart.

01:34.633 --> 01:35.895
Taro-sama...

01:36.768 --> 01:39.635
I have been waiting for you.

01:42.908 --> 01:44.773
M-Mariel...

01:46.845 --> 01:48.574
N-No.

01:48.647 --> 01:50.581
You're the head maid, right?

01:50.649 --> 01:52.241
I don't care.

01:52.317 --> 01:54.911
I can't contain myself anymore.

01:55.854 --> 01:58.652
Taro-sama, I love you...

02:03.028 --> 02:04.689
Mariel...

02:04.763 --> 02:05.991
Taro-sama...

02:22.480 --> 02:27.383
A 10-Game Match?

02:27.752 --> 02:30.778
Kiss, kiss, kiss!

02:30.855 --> 02:32.948
First kiss with Taro-sama.

02:34.125 --> 02:36.286
She took the first kiss...

02:36.361 --> 02:38.761
Then I'll take the first deep kiss!

02:38.830 --> 02:41.424
Oh, then I'll take the first lay!

02:41.499 --> 02:42.761
In which case...

02:42.834 --> 02:44.529
Here we come!

02:55.981 --> 02:58.779
In any case,
that was a weird dream...

03:04.155 --> 03:05.850
Dream, it was a dream...

03:06.758 --> 03:08.282
But...

03:08.360 --> 03:10.351
That's not a dream, is it...

03:12.163 --> 03:13.289
Taro-sama.

03:14.899 --> 03:16.389
Good morning.

03:17.402 --> 03:18.596
Morning.

03:19.337 --> 03:21.965
Here is your schedule for today.

03:22.040 --> 03:24.975
First, breakfast at 7:30.

03:25.043 --> 03:27.671
After that, a walk in the garden.

03:27.746 --> 03:30.112
From 9 o'clock,
official business...

03:31.583 --> 03:33.107
Is anything wrong?

03:36.921 --> 03:37.888
No.

03:38.723 --> 03:40.122
Is that so?

03:41.559 --> 03:43.117
Mariel-sama?

03:43.194 --> 03:47.824
Yeah, about her character,
or how she is...

03:47.899 --> 03:52.632
Could it be that you're
interested in Mariel-sama?

03:52.704 --> 03:53.864
Lover boy!

03:53.938 --> 03:58.102
N-No, I don't mean like that...

03:58.176 --> 03:59.609
But just...

03:59.677 --> 04:00.735
All right.

04:00.812 --> 04:03.975
It is your request, after all.

04:04.049 --> 04:08.008
I'll tell you
Mariel-sama's top secret.

04:08.086 --> 04:09.348
Secret?

04:09.921 --> 04:12.515
To tell the truth, Mariel-sama...

04:12.590 --> 04:14.114
...has children.

04:14.192 --> 04:15.284
What?

04:16.528 --> 04:21.556
Mischievous but kindhearted
Sho-kun and quiet Haruka-chan.

04:22.434 --> 04:24.994
Surrounded by two
children and a husband...

04:25.070 --> 04:27.766
...she was living a very happy life.

04:28.840 --> 04:29.966
Till that day...

04:32.444 --> 04:34.139
Till that day?

04:34.212 --> 04:36.442
I can't tell you any more...

04:39.884 --> 04:42.284
Hey, Ikuyo-chan.

04:42.353 --> 04:43.320
Yes?

04:44.122 --> 04:46.454
- It's a lie, right?
- Was it obvious?

04:46.524 --> 04:47.582
What's the truth?

04:49.594 --> 04:52.256
Honestly, I don't really know.

04:52.330 --> 04:55.322
She doesn't talk
much about herself...

04:56.868 --> 04:57.835
Cynthia?

05:01.639 --> 05:02.765
I see...

05:08.546 --> 05:13.483
In the end, no one
knows much about Mariel...

05:22.427 --> 05:23.394
What?

05:57.996 --> 06:00.658
What a messy mansion,
as always.

06:03.201 --> 06:04.668
Midget over there.

06:04.736 --> 06:06.499
M-Me?

06:06.571 --> 06:08.505
Who else is here?

06:08.573 --> 06:11.371
Go get your so-called
new family head.

06:11.442 --> 06:12.966
New family head...

06:27.125 --> 06:30.492
Don't extend a dirty hand at me!

06:31.296 --> 06:32.763
Rude bastard!

06:32.830 --> 06:35.162
Who do you think I am?

06:35.233 --> 06:37.531
I am the Jihioh
family's next head...

06:37.602 --> 06:39.467
...Ryuka Jihioh-sama!

06:40.205 --> 06:41.866
U-Um...

06:43.641 --> 06:45.768
What are you gaping at?

06:45.843 --> 06:50.712
Well, I know you're attracted
to my unsurpassed beauty...

06:50.782 --> 06:53.444
No, not that...

06:53.518 --> 06:54.542
Your panties...

06:56.120 --> 06:57.246
No!

06:57.322 --> 07:00.519
Don't look, you rude bastard!

07:03.328 --> 07:04.659
Ryuka-sama.

07:04.729 --> 07:08.961
Mariel, the quality of the maids
seems to have decreased again.

07:09.033 --> 07:11.729
Keeping a midget like
him in the mansion...

07:12.770 --> 07:17.366
Anyway, fetch the so-called new
family head, Taro Hanaukyo, now.

07:17.442 --> 07:19.137
Taro-sama is there.

07:20.812 --> 07:21.779
Where?

07:21.846 --> 07:22.813
There.

07:26.184 --> 07:27.674
So where?

07:30.088 --> 07:33.023
The one that you
kicked was the master.

07:36.327 --> 07:37.453
Hi...

07:37.528 --> 07:40.190
T-That can't be...

07:40.265 --> 07:41.823
That can't be...

07:41.899 --> 07:43.423
I can't believe that!

07:43.501 --> 07:44.068
New family head

07:44.068 --> 07:46.137
New family head
One like this is
the new family head...

07:46.137 --> 07:46.865
One like this is
the new family head...

07:46.938 --> 07:48.599
What misfortune.

07:48.673 --> 07:50.163
What a nightmare.

07:50.241 --> 07:51.765
What a bad ending!

07:52.577 --> 07:53.645
I can't believe that midget
is the new family head...

07:53.645 --> 07:55.079
I can't believe that midget
is the new family head...
Jihioh family?

07:55.079 --> 07:56.047
I can't believe that midget
is the new family head...
Yes.

07:56.047 --> 08:01.085
I can't believe that midget
is the new family head...
A distinguished family that we've
split power with since long ago.

08:01.085 --> 08:03.454
I can't believe that midget
is the new family head...
In short, they are like our rivals.

08:03.454 --> 08:04.421
In short, they are like our rivals.

08:04.489 --> 08:05.683
Rivals?

08:05.757 --> 08:08.191
Would you stop
saying such rude things?

08:08.259 --> 08:12.593
Originally, the Jihioh family,
as symbolized by the Jungfrau...

08:12.664 --> 08:16.293
...was a noble family
yours couldn't compare to.

08:16.367 --> 08:18.597
You've outdone us now.

08:18.670 --> 08:21.366
But we couldn't care
less about you before...

08:21.439 --> 08:23.737
...like cooked school lunch algae.

08:27.145 --> 08:29.204
Listen to me!

08:30.014 --> 08:33.609
I, Ryuka-sama, was gracious
enough to come over.

08:33.685 --> 08:35.152
Respect me.

08:35.953 --> 08:37.511
Be reverent.

08:37.588 --> 08:39.988
Throw yourself at my feet.

08:40.058 --> 08:41.548
She's full of energy.

08:41.626 --> 08:42.593
Yes.

08:50.802 --> 08:51.860
Marriage?

08:53.271 --> 08:55.296
W-Wait a minute.

08:55.373 --> 08:57.807
Get married? You and me?

08:57.875 --> 08:59.467
I'm very reluctant.

08:59.544 --> 09:03.981
It's regrettable and heartbreaking,
but there's nothing I can do.

09:04.048 --> 09:05.174
No way...

09:05.616 --> 09:06.674
No way.

09:06.751 --> 09:09.584
Because you don't
like me, do you?

09:10.788 --> 09:12.221
Of course not!

09:12.290 --> 09:15.225
Are you fine with marrying
someone you don't love?

09:15.293 --> 09:16.988
Are you happy with that?

09:23.501 --> 09:26.026
In order to become
the Jihioh family's head...

09:26.104 --> 09:27.799
...that is the condition.

09:30.541 --> 09:33.510
M-Marry the Hanaukyo
family's head?

09:33.578 --> 09:34.636
Yes.

09:34.712 --> 09:38.273
That is my condition for
yielding my position to you.

09:38.349 --> 09:41.477
If you don't like it,
give up the position.

09:41.552 --> 09:43.042
T-That...

09:43.988 --> 09:48.084
The position of Jihioh family head
is my grandest dream.

09:48.159 --> 09:52.118
I will accept a grudging
marriage for it.

09:52.196 --> 09:54.460
That is the chosen one's fate.

09:55.299 --> 09:56.459
Her trial.

09:57.502 --> 10:00.994
Oh, I don't need any
words of comfort...

10:01.072 --> 10:02.061
I...

10:02.140 --> 10:04.472
Yeah, this is delicious.

10:05.510 --> 10:08.479
Oh, do you want to eat
cookies too, Ryuka-san?

10:12.917 --> 10:15.511
So you have no objections
to the marriage, right?

10:15.586 --> 10:16.450
I do.

10:16.521 --> 10:18.182
Do you hate me?

10:18.256 --> 10:19.621
Not really.

10:19.690 --> 10:22.318
Then someone else
is on your mind?

10:23.394 --> 10:24.986
N-No...

10:25.062 --> 10:26.256
It's not that...

10:28.633 --> 10:31.659
It's just that I think
the maids here...

10:31.736 --> 10:36.173
...will also have a hard time if
I get married to the Jihioh family.

10:36.941 --> 10:38.568
What do you think?

10:40.178 --> 10:41.304
Well...

10:43.347 --> 10:45.178
If Taro-sama is fine with it...

10:49.754 --> 10:51.381
Y-You're cruel...

10:52.190 --> 10:53.157
I see.

10:53.958 --> 10:55.823
I fully grasp the situation.

10:55.893 --> 11:01.229
If I show you my superiority and
value compared to this maid...

11:01.299 --> 11:04.063
...you don't need
to wonder, do you?

11:06.571 --> 11:07.868
Let's settle this.

11:07.939 --> 11:09.338
All right?

11:09.407 --> 11:10.601
Yes...

11:11.976 --> 11:16.572
Hanaukyo Maid Team

11:16.647 --> 11:20.310
Ryuka Jihioh vs. Mariel
10-Game Match

11:21.919 --> 11:23.443
Hi, Konoe-san.

11:24.589 --> 11:27.786
Will you allow one of
the Jihioh family to do this?

11:27.859 --> 11:31.659
I can't help it because
she says she won't back off.

11:31.729 --> 11:35.460
The Jihioh family is the rival
of the Hanaukyo family!

11:35.533 --> 11:36.830
But...

11:36.901 --> 11:39.665
Ryuka-san doesn't seem
to be a bad person...

11:39.737 --> 11:40.897
But...

11:40.972 --> 11:43.031
Yashima, that's enough.

11:43.107 --> 11:45.075
Our master has decided.

11:45.142 --> 11:46.109
Let's go.

11:55.453 --> 11:58.286
You won't call me Taro, huh?

12:00.424 --> 12:03.154
The master is the master.

12:03.227 --> 12:04.489
Excuse me.

12:09.033 --> 12:11.331
Ryuka Jihioh vs. Mariel
10-Game Match

12:11.469 --> 12:15.166
Well then, the battle
between the two will begin.

12:15.239 --> 12:18.037
All right, we will
compete in ten events.

12:18.109 --> 12:19.701
Majority wins.

12:19.777 --> 12:20.266
Right.

12:21.412 --> 12:23.403
You're the judge.

12:23.481 --> 12:24.709
Y-Yeah...

12:24.782 --> 12:25.082
Game 1
Cooking

12:25.082 --> 12:27.380
Game 1
Cooking
Then the first game's
a cooking battle!

12:31.856 --> 12:33.221
Mariel wins!

12:33.291 --> 12:34.883
What?

12:34.959 --> 12:36.756
Without tasting?

12:36.827 --> 12:37.428
Game 2
Laundry

12:37.428 --> 12:38.725
Game 2
Laundry
The second game is laundry.

12:44.702 --> 12:45.498
Done!

12:47.805 --> 12:48.072
Game 3
Improvised Performance

12:48.072 --> 12:50.007
Game 3
Improvised Performance
The third game is
improvised performance!

12:50.007 --> 12:50.473
The third game is
improvised performance!

12:50.541 --> 12:53.738
I heard the wall next
door is made of brick.

12:53.811 --> 12:55.972
The Jihioh family's is marble.

13:02.219 --> 13:04.312
Dog impression.

13:04.388 --> 13:05.013
Woof!

13:07.758 --> 13:08.884
Why?

13:09.026 --> 13:09.924
Game 4
Flower Arrangement

13:14.932 --> 13:15.830
Game 5
Koto

13:21.339 --> 13:22.237
Game 6
Painting

13:27.478 --> 13:29.070
Mariel Ryuka

13:29.814 --> 13:32.146
This concludes the match!

13:32.216 --> 13:34.150
Winner, Mariel!

13:35.353 --> 13:37.048
Wait!

13:37.121 --> 13:40.056
I didn't expect to be
driven into a corner...

13:41.192 --> 13:42.489
But!

13:42.560 --> 13:44.289
The game hasn't ended yet.

13:44.362 --> 13:45.488
Look!

13:46.931 --> 13:48.296
Ryuka Jihioh vs. Mariel
10-Game Match

13:48.366 --> 13:49.890
10-Game Match

13:49.967 --> 13:51.229
100-Game Match

13:53.804 --> 13:54.038
Ryuka Jihioh vs. Mariel
100-Game Match

13:54.038 --> 13:55.439
Ryuka Jihioh vs. Mariel
100-Game Match
The game has just started!

13:55.439 --> 13:55.803
The game has just started!

13:55.873 --> 13:57.101
Let's go.

13:57.174 --> 13:58.163
Be prepared!

13:58.242 --> 13:59.231
Right.

13:59.310 --> 14:01.676
Is it okay, Mariel?

14:01.746 --> 14:05.147
Yes, it is all right with me...

14:09.053 --> 14:12.921
1000-Game Match

14:12.990 --> 14:15.322
Ryuka Jihioh vs. Mariel
1000-Game Match

14:20.331 --> 14:23.061
Game number 498...

14:24.335 --> 14:26.166
A word game with food...

14:26.237 --> 14:27.101
From "A"...

14:27.171 --> 14:29.605
A-Andes Melon...

14:30.708 --> 14:31.333
Bread!

14:33.411 --> 14:34.776
Mariel Ryuka

14:35.212 --> 14:37.476
Isn't it about time we stopped?

14:37.548 --> 14:38.776
Silence!

14:38.849 --> 14:41.249
It was all a handicap up till now.

14:41.318 --> 14:45.311
I'll reverse the situation now
and win a splendid victory.

14:46.090 --> 14:47.057
Be...

14:48.826 --> 14:49.884
...prepared.

14:50.928 --> 14:53.192
Game number 500...

14:53.264 --> 14:54.856
Metal tub catch.

15:02.973 --> 15:04.406
Did you wake up?

15:06.477 --> 15:08.775
W-What is this place?

15:09.680 --> 15:13.013
The medical office,
since you collapsed.

15:13.084 --> 15:15.348
Colla... N-No.

15:15.419 --> 15:16.545
That was...

15:17.621 --> 15:19.248
I'll peel you an apple.

15:22.860 --> 15:25.454
But you're amazing...

15:26.530 --> 15:30.091
You just take challenge after
challenge, no matter how hard.

15:30.167 --> 15:33.432
Even when you're about
to lose, you never give up.

15:33.504 --> 15:36.905
If it were me, I would've
given up a long time ago.

15:39.510 --> 15:43.446
I-I don't want to be compared
to a midget like you.

15:45.649 --> 15:46.980
Hey...

15:47.051 --> 15:49.815
Is it that important
to be family head?

15:52.523 --> 15:56.687
I don't think it's good for a proud
and honest person like you...

15:56.761 --> 16:01.027
...to decide whom to marry
based on such a reason.

16:01.098 --> 16:03.464
Proud and honest...

16:03.534 --> 16:04.660
Me?

16:04.735 --> 16:05.827
Yeah.

16:12.743 --> 16:14.870
You still have spittle.

16:17.081 --> 16:19.242
W-What are you doing?

16:22.019 --> 16:23.611
Does it taste good?

16:23.687 --> 16:25.348
It's so-so...

16:28.893 --> 16:31.361
Um, how is she?

16:31.428 --> 16:33.157
She seems all right now.

16:33.230 --> 16:34.527
I see.

16:34.598 --> 16:37.567
I seem to have caused
you trouble this time.

16:37.635 --> 16:39.034
I'm very sorry.

16:41.238 --> 16:43.866
Your apology makes
me more upset!

16:43.941 --> 16:48.605
Well, we'll be going,
so you can rest a little longer.

16:54.852 --> 16:56.752
W-Wait.

16:57.721 --> 17:01.088
Mariel, the game
hasn't ended yet!

17:01.859 --> 17:02.826
But...

17:02.893 --> 17:03.985
Silence!

17:04.695 --> 17:07.095
I haven't given up.

17:07.164 --> 17:09.564
Get the next match
ready right away!

17:09.633 --> 17:10.930
Um...

17:11.001 --> 17:12.127
This...

17:12.236 --> 17:14.067
Ryuka Jihioh vs. Mariel
1000-Game Match

17:14.205 --> 17:17.663
It won't be as easy as before.

17:17.741 --> 17:18.969
That's...

17:19.043 --> 17:22.535
She's challenging Mariel
with her favorite event.

17:22.613 --> 17:23.580
Favorite?

17:23.647 --> 17:25.808
Yes, Info Staff research...

17:25.883 --> 17:29.114
...says Ryuka Jihioh-sama
is known as a military maniac.

17:29.186 --> 17:30.778
Wow...

17:30.855 --> 17:32.982
Well then, game number 500!

17:35.259 --> 17:38.751
You just take challenge after
challenge, no matter how hard.

17:39.797 --> 17:40.889
That's right.

17:40.965 --> 17:43.661
I should've challenged her
with my favorite things.

17:44.702 --> 17:45.464
Start!

17:53.444 --> 17:55.002
I missed it...

17:55.079 --> 17:57.047
l-I won!

17:57.114 --> 17:58.672
Mariel Ryuka

17:58.749 --> 18:00.580
Game number 502!

18:02.653 --> 18:03.687
Done.

18:03.687 --> 18:04.054
Weaponry Quiz
Done.

18:04.054 --> 18:05.422
Weaponry Quiz
Game number 503!

18:05.422 --> 18:05.683
Weaponry Quiz

18:07.725 --> 18:10.319
General Electric J 79 Turbo Jet!

18:12.563 --> 18:16.465
Vickers L7 A151 Caliber
105 mm Tank Gun!

18:18.636 --> 18:21.969
Line Metal 44 Caliber
120 mm Glide Gun!

18:27.645 --> 18:28.805
Mariel Ryuka

18:30.547 --> 18:32.777
I didn't expect
her to tie the points...

18:32.850 --> 18:35.717
So why the pool?

18:38.989 --> 18:41.924
The final battle
between women...

18:41.992 --> 18:44.426
...must be a water cavalry battle.

18:44.495 --> 18:45.553
Is that so?

18:45.629 --> 18:46.391
Dunno.

18:47.431 --> 18:49.126
U-Um...

18:49.199 --> 18:50.860
...is this all right?

18:53.170 --> 18:55.434
Taro-sama, you're too obvious.

18:55.506 --> 18:58.634
All right, lose the headband
and you lose the game!

19:00.110 --> 19:01.338
Right.

19:01.412 --> 19:04.313
Then final battle, ready...

19:04.381 --> 19:05.405
Go!

19:12.489 --> 19:13.820
Go!

19:22.566 --> 19:23.794
I won't let you!

19:26.603 --> 19:27.627
I see it.

19:36.981 --> 19:38.073
Which one?

19:48.025 --> 19:49.117
Ryuka-san wins!

19:52.696 --> 19:53.822
I did it...

19:54.865 --> 19:56.264
I did it!

19:59.169 --> 20:01.194
It's too bad, Mariel.

20:01.271 --> 20:02.829
Yes, it is.

20:02.906 --> 20:06.103
But you seem to be
pleased, so I'm glad.

20:11.081 --> 20:12.446
It's ridiculous.

20:12.516 --> 20:16.475
I'm not remotely happy with
winning such a dull game.

20:17.354 --> 20:21.586
So I'll let you win this time
as an exception, Mariel.

20:22.960 --> 20:24.222
But that's...

20:24.294 --> 20:25.283
However.

20:25.362 --> 20:28.092
I will challenge you
again next time.

20:28.165 --> 20:31.328
To win the position
as wife of this man.

20:31.402 --> 20:32.801
Wife?

20:32.870 --> 20:36.169
Yes, I will not lose at that time.

20:39.476 --> 20:42.343
What are you grinning at,
happy-face?

20:43.113 --> 20:44.603
You irritate me!

20:44.681 --> 20:48.310
Irritate! Irritate!
Irritate! Irritate! Irritate!

20:50.654 --> 20:52.713
"I will not lose," huh?

20:56.994 --> 21:01.294
Maybe she means that, after all?

21:02.800 --> 21:04.563
Thank you for waiting.

21:04.635 --> 21:05.897
Let's go on...

21:05.969 --> 21:08.597
...with this morning's
unfinished business.

21:08.672 --> 21:12.039
Ready, set, kiss!

21:14.678 --> 21:16.441
Taro-sama!

21:16.513 --> 21:19.243
Jeez, he makes quick getaways!

21:34.998 --> 21:36.295
Mariel...

21:45.776 --> 21:49.041
Warera ni omakase kudasai.

21:49.113 --> 21:51.775
Hanaukyo Maid Tai.

21:52.316 --> 21:55.410
Osewa sasete itadakimasu.

21:55.486 --> 21:58.649
Osoba goyo tai.

21:58.722 --> 22:01.816
Oki ni mesuyouni tsuneni.

22:01.892 --> 22:04.417
Yaruki runrun nandesu.

22:05.162 --> 22:08.325
Kokoro to karada wo migaki.

22:08.398 --> 22:11.333
Goyou nannarito.

22:11.401 --> 22:22.972
Yorokonde yorokonde
hoshii dake desu.

22:24.014 --> 22:34.652
Sorenanoni sorenanoni
tsurenai ohito.

22:36.860 --> 22:43.026
Hoshiga hora kirei desu.

22:43.100 --> 22:49.664
Asu mo hare deshou.

22:49.740 --> 22:56.009
Konya mone yume demone...

22:56.079 --> 23:00.413
...osewa shichau.

23:10.027 --> 23:12.052
Who is Grace?

23:12.129 --> 23:14.996
You've already
seen her, Taro-sama.

23:15.365 --> 23:16.593
Where, where?

23:16.667 --> 23:19.261
Episode 3, Cynthia and Grace.

23:19.336 --> 23:21.438
We'll serve you next
time as well, Master.

23:21.438 --> 23:22.306
Next Episode
